<title>USA: N.Y. $25 mln dorms repriced, ylds six pct in 2037.</title>
<headline>N.Y. $25 mln dorms repriced, ylds six pct in 2037.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Albany Corporation said Wednesday repriced New York State Dormitory Authority's $25 million bond deal. The top yield at the repricing was six percent in 2037.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:  </p>
<p>DORMITORY AUTHORITY OF THE STATE OF NEW YORK</p>
<p>RE: $25,075,000*</p>
<p>FAIRPORT BAPTIST HOMES</p>
<p>FHA INSURED MORTGAGE NURSING HOME REVENUE BONDS,</p>
<p>SERIES 1997</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>PLEASE NOTE THE CHANGE IN STRUCTURE AND PRICE.</p>
<p>ALL ORDERS WILL BE CONSIDERED GOOD AT THE NEW LEVELS UNLESS WE</p>
<p>HEAR OTHERWISE BY 4:00PM TODAY, FEBRUARY 26, 1997.</p>
<p>					    22,915,000*</p>
<p>					    SERIES 1997A</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: NR		    S&amp;P: AA</p>
<p>    DATED: 02/15/1997	    FIRST COUPON: 08/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 02/01</p>
<p>ALL BONDS ARE PRICED AT PAR.</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON</p>
<p>02/01/2013		2,975M    5.50  %</p>
<p>						  (Avg. Life: 6.189 years)</p>
<p>02/01/2022		3,140M    5.90  %</p>
<p>						  (Avg. Life: 12.366 years)</p>
